<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Глава 7. Функции on GoToGo</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/go/go-to-go/chapter-07/</link><description>Recent content in Глава 7. Функции on GoToGo</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://gotogolang.github.io/go/go-to-go/chapter-07/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Объявление функций</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/go/go-to-go/chapter-07/01-declaration/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/go/go-to-go/chapter-07/01-declaration/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="синтаксис" class=link_owner>
 Синтаксис
 &lt;a href="#%d1%81%d0%b8%d0%bd%d1%82%d0%b0%d0%ba%d1%81%d0%b8%d1%81" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">add&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Если несколько параметров одного типа — тип можно указать один раз:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">add&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="несколько-возвращаемых-значений" class=link_owner>
 Несколько возвращаемых значений
 &lt;a href="#%d0%bd%d0%b5%d1%81%d0%ba%d0%be%d0%bb%d1%8c%d0%ba%d0%be-%d0%b2%d0%be%d0%b7%d0%b2%d1%80%d0%b0%d1%89%d0%b0%d0%b5%d0%bc%d1%8b%d1%85-%d0%b7%d0%bd%d0%b0%d1%87%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b9" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Go позволяет возвращать несколько значений — это стандартный способ передачи ошибок:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">divide&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">float64&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">float64&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">error&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Errorf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;деление на ноль&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">a&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">/&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">b&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">nil&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">result&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">divide&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">nil&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">log&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Fatal&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="именованные-возвращаемые-значения" class=link_owner>
 Именованные возвращаемые значения
 &lt;a href="#%d0%b8%d0%bc%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%be%d0%b2%d0%b0%d0%bd%d0%bd%d1%8b%d0%b5-%d0%b2%d0%be%d0%b7%d0%b2%d1%80%d0%b0%d1%89%d0%b0%d0%b5%d0%bc%d1%8b%d0%b5-%d0%b7%d0%bd%d0%b0%d1%87%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%b8%d1%8f" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Возвращаемые значения можно именовать — тогда &lt;code>return&lt;/code> без аргументов вернёт их текущие значения:&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Анонимные функции и замыкания</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/go/go-to-go/chapter-07/02-closures/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/go/go-to-go/chapter-07/02-closures/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="анонимная-функция" class=link_owner>
 Анонимная функция
 &lt;a href="#%d0%b0%d0%bd%d0%be%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%bc%d0%bd%d0%b0%d1%8f-%d1%84%d1%83%d0%bd%d0%ba%d1%86%d0%b8%d1%8f" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Функция без имени, определённая прямо в выражении:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">double&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">2&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">double&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">5&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">))&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 10&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Можно вызвать немедленно (IIFE):&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">result&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">x&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">y&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">x&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">+&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">y&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">3&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">4&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">result&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 7&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="замыкание" class=link_owner>
 Замыкание
 &lt;a href="#%d0%b7%d0%b0%d0%bc%d1%8b%d0%ba%d0%b0%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b5" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Анонимная функция «захватывает» переменные из окружающей области видимости:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">counter&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">++&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">c&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">counter&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">c&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">())&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">c&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">())&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 2&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Println&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">c&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">())&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// 3&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>n&lt;/code> живёт, пока жива функция &lt;code>c&lt;/code> — сборщик мусора не удалит её раньше.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Обработка ошибок</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/go/go-to-go/chapter-07/03-error-handling/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/go/go-to-go/chapter-07/03-error-handling/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="error--встроенный-интерфейс" class=link_owner>
 error — встроенный интерфейс
 &lt;a href="#error--%d0%b2%d1%81%d1%82%d1%80%d0%be%d0%b5%d0%bd%d0%bd%d1%8b%d0%b9-%d0%b8%d0%bd%d1%82%d0%b5%d1%80%d1%84%d0%b5%d0%b9%d1%81" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>В Go нет исключений. Ошибка — обычное значение, которое функция возвращает последним:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">type&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">error&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">interface&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">Error&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">string&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="создание-ошибок" class=link_owner>
 Создание ошибок
 &lt;a href="#%d1%81%d0%be%d0%b7%d0%b4%d0%b0%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b5-%d0%be%d1%88%d0%b8%d0%b1%d0%be%d0%ba" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kn">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;errors&amp;#34;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">ErrNotFound&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">errors&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">New&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;not found&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">find&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">id&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">string&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">error&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">id&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Errorf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;некорректный id: %d&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">id&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">id&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">100&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">ErrNotFound&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;item&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">nil&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;h2 id="проверка-и-оборачивание" class=link_owner>
 Проверка и оборачивание
 &lt;a href="#%d0%bf%d1%80%d0%be%d0%b2%d0%b5%d1%80%d0%ba%d0%b0-%d0%b8-%d0%be%d0%b1%d0%be%d1%80%d0%b0%d1%87%d0%b8%d0%b2%d0%b0%d0%bd%d0%b8%d0%b5" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Ошибки можно оборачивать (&lt;code>%w&lt;/code>), сохраняя цепочку:&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">doSomething&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">();&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">!=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">nil&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">fmt&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">Errorf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;шаг X: %w&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">err&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Развернуть цепочку:&lt;/p>
